# Heat off the Burning's ground, read at a glance from both cameras: ember lines
# lifting either side of the body, never the white vapour breath is drawn in
# (MobFx.shimmer, HazardCues `heat`). At noon, where it bites, and at 18:30,
# where it is only felt, each from above and over the shoulder, each frame half
# a second into a mark's life (`await shimmer` is its first moment; a mark is too
# short-lived for a shot to claim it).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/heat-shimmer.tour --seed=1 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
place burning
hour 13
await bites:heat 40
await shimmer 12
wait 0.5
shot 01-heat-from-above-noon with land:burning
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
await shimmer 12
wait 0.5
shot 02-heat-over-the-shoulder-noon with shoulder
release shoulder_peek
await top_view 5
hour 18.5
await heat 20
await shimmer 20
wait 0.5
shot 03-heat-from-above-dusk with land:burning
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
await shimmer 20
wait 0.5
shot 04-heat-over-the-shoulder-dusk with shoulder
release shoulder_peek
